sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as API Role
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker Role
  participant H as Harness
  participant E as Agent Engine
  participant T as Tool Runtime

  B->>A: POST /api/v1/runs
  A->>P: Insert Run + Outbox
  A-->>B: 202 runId/eventsUrl
  B->>A: GET /runs/{id}/events (Last-Event-ID)
  A->>P: Replay events after sequence
  P-->>W: Lease pending Run
  W->>H: Start/Resume Run
  H->>E: Execute Invocation
  E->>T: Invoke governed Tool
  T-->>E: ToolOutcome
  E-->>H: EngineEvent / OutputDelta
  H->>P: State + RunEvent + Checkpoint
  P-->>A: LISTEN/NOTIFY wake-up
  A->>P: Read new ordered events
  A-->>B: SSE RunEvent/UI projection
